                "message": "✨ Convert the .bib files to BibLaTeX field names and Unicode accents\n\n- sp-bibtex-biblatex: journal, address, place, school (and two aliases) renamed to\n  the BibLaTeX names; BibTeX accents written as Unicode; dates, citekeys and file\n  names never touched\n- dry-run report, one question, backup and restore (C-; L b f L, l, r)\n- skips binary and non-UTF-8 files; extends the dialect with the types in the file\n- architecture note on bibtex-mode, citar and Typst support\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCxFkKhzC6rHZfA9ea",
